{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Export_BMP_Settings}
\pard\keepn \fs36\cf1 Export BMP Settings
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 This is a tab on the \uldb Export BMP Dialog\plain\fs24 {\v Export_BMP_file}   \tab \tab \tab \tab  To change the directory see \uldb \b User Preferences\plain\b\fs24 {\v 6T9R6I@leoserv.hlp}\plain\fs24 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx5755\cellx8855\pard\intbl 
