\pard\keepn\tx355 \b\fs36\cf1 Graticule Object
\par \pard\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par \pard\tx355 This object displays a grid over the \uldb \b Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v GIRNF0@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24 . The parameters from this object can be modified by using the \uldb \b Graticule Spacing Dialog\plain\b\fs24 {\v 199M5I2@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24 . This object is created by selecting \uldb \b Graticule\plain\b\fs24 {\v AQG_VH@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24  from the SEM \uldb \b Menu Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v 8ZP0K4@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24 . 
