\pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \{bmc bm31.bmp\}  When objects are already present on the \uldb \b Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v GIRNF0@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24 , the user is asked if they wish to \b merge\plain\fs24  or \b discard\plain\fs24  the existing annotation. \b Merging\plain\fs24  the saved annotation will add the annotation objects to the current set of annotation objects on display. \b Discarding\plain\fs24  the existing annotation will remove the current annotation on display. Merged annotation appears behind the last of the current objects at the bottom of the z-order (behind all other annotation objects).
