{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Measurement Warning}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Measurement_Warning}
\pard\tx355 \b\fs36\cf1 Measurement Warning
\par \plain\fs24 \{bmc bm3.bmp\}\tab \b WARNING CONCERNING MEASUREMENT 
\par 
\par \plain\fs24 If a TIFF image is imported which is less than full size (due to spatial reduction or saving only part of an image) then there is no constraint on where the image is loaded in relation to the scanned image. 
\par The determination of which zone applies to which portion of the image is governed by the position within the scanned image, and this information is used in measurement. 
\par It therefore follows that if a portion of image which was in \ul \b\ul Zone 0\plain\b\fs24 {\v Zone}\plain\fs24  when saved is inserted into a position in the scanned image corresponding to zone 1 and zones 0 and 1 have different pixel sizes then any measurement performed will be \b incorrect\plain\fs24 .
\par \page
{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Measuring Image Features}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Measuring_Image_Features}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Measuring Image Features
\par \pard \plain\fs24 There is a wide range of measuring image features:
\par 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm87.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Zone Magnification\plain\b\fs24 {\v Zone_Magnification}\plain\fs24  will display the correct magnification for the zone of the image in which they are positioned, even if the zone has been frozen. For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Zone Mag Annotation\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Zone_Mag_Annotation}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm88.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Micron Marker\plain\b\fs24 {\v Micron_Marker}\plain\fs24  will display the correct micron bar for the zone of the image in which they are positioned, even if the zone has been frozen. For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Micron Marker\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Micron_Marker}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm58.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Fixed Micron Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Fixed_Micron_Bar}\plain\fs24  will display the correct micron bar for the zone of the image in which they are positioned, even if the zone has been frozen. For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Fixed Micron Bar\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Fixed_Micron_Bar}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm89.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Point to Point\plain\b\fs24 {\v Point_to_Point}\plain\fs24  displays a pair of pointers on features of the image and the distance plus rotational difference .
\par\intbl For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Point to Point Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Point_to_Point_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm11.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Angular Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Angular_Measurement}\plain\fs24  facilities are also provided.
\par\intbl For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Angular Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Angular_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm81.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Line Width\plain\b\fs24 {\v Line_Width}\plain\fs24  displays a box which can be positioned over a feature and the width and breadth of the box displayed.
\par\intbl For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Line Width Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Line_Width_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm90.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Radial Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Radial_Measurement}\plain\fs24  puts a circle over a feature and annotates the radius.
\par\intbl For properties like font, background, alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Radial Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Radial_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm91.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Width Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Width_Measurement}\plain\fs24  displays a pair of vertical lines and the space between them.
\par\intbl For properties like alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Width Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Width_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
\trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx845\cellx13535\pard\intbl \{bmc bm63.bmp\}\cell\pard \pard\intbl \uldb \b Height Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Height_Measurement}\plain\fs24  displays a pair of vertical lines and the space between them.
\par\intbl For properties like alignment see \uldb \b Properties of Height Measurement\plain\b\fs24 {\v Properties_of_Height_Measurement}\plain\fs24 \cell\intbl\row
