\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 This mode is mainly used when annotation is being added and the toolbar is required, but parameter adjustment is also required prior to switching off the Image Manager Toolbar.
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 This mode also affects the Image Manager \uldb \b Context Sensitive Popup Menu\plain\b\fs24 {\v Context_Sensitive_Popup_Menu}\plain\fs24 .
\par \pard\tx355 
\par \pard\tx355 See also \uldb \b Mouse Control\plain\b\fs24 {\v Mouse_Control}\plain\fs24 
