\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 \plain\fs24 
\par \tab \uldb \b Sticky Panel Font Property\plain\b\fs24 {\v Set_Panel_Font}\tab \uldb Snap to Grid Property\plain\b\fs24 {\v Snap_to_Grid_Property}\plain\fs24 \tab \uldb \b Results Parameter Selections\plain\b\fs24 {\v Results_Parameter_Selections}\plain\fs24 \tab \uldb \b Update Results Property\plain\b\fs24 {\v Update_Results_Property}\plain\fs24 
\par 
\par \{bmc bm4.bmp\} Note : When a group of objects are selected, right \ul clicking\plain\fs24 {\v CLICK@Sem.HLP} on any of the selected objects brings up a properties menu that is constructed from all of the available properties from all of the selected objects. If for example a \uldb \b Caption Property\plain\b\fs24 {\v Caption_Property}\plain\fs24  is available for some objects and not for others, when the caption property is changed, only those options that have a caption property are affected.
