\par 
\par \trowd\trgaph105\trleft-116 \cellx8495\cellx11595\pard\intbl The \uldb \b selected object\plain\b\fs24 {\v Object_Selection}\plain\fs24  can be moved by \ul dragging\plain\fs24 {\v DRAG@Sem.HLP} its selection \ul handles\plain\fs24 {\v Handles@Sem.HLP} or lines to the desired \uldb \b Image Window\plain\b\fs24 {\v GIRNF0@Sem.HLP}\plain\fs24  area with the mouse. As the object is dragged, the SEM Spot Mode parameters are set to these new values.
