\par\intbl \b \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\plain\fs24 \tab The magnification at the selected place of the Image Window will be shown.
\par\intbl 
\par\intbl \b \{bmc bm1.bmp\}\plain\fs24 \tab Click on \b Annotation Mode Icon\plain\fs24  \{bmc bm7.bmp\}  to leave the Zone Magnification Mode.
\par\intbl 
