\pard 
\par \pard\li355\fi-355\tx355 The coordinates of the display are shown in the \uldb Status Bar\plain\fs24 {\v RDJHU5@Sem.HLP}. \{bmc bm138.bmp\}
\par (From corner X/Y to opposite corner X/Y, centre X/Y, size X/Y)
\par 
