{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} Print No.}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} Print_No.}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 Print No.
\par \pard \plain\fs24 This parameter which is displayed on the \uldb \b Print Setup dialog\plain\b\fs24 {\v Print_Setup_Dialog}\plain\fs24  may be set to any required value.
\par The value will be incremented when each print is made.
\par The Print No. parameter may also be displayed as an annotation parameter if required.
\par 
\par Note that the \b Photo No.\plain\fs24  parameter is incremented when any export (file, print or HRRU photo) is executed.
\par \page
