{\up $}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up $} String Parameters}
{\up #}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up #} String_Parameters}
{\up >}{\footnote\pard\plain{\up >} main}
\pard\keepn \b\fs36\cf1 String Parameters
\par \pard \plain\fs24 The following parameters are provided which may be used for annotation.
\par 
\par \b User Name\plain\fs24 . This read only parameter is set to the Log On User name.
\par \b Operator\plain\fs24 . This read/Write parameter may be set to the operator Name. The setting is preserved.
\par \b File Name\plain\fs24 . This read only parameter is set to the name of the last file saved or loaded. Note that the parameter is updated on receipt of the output command and before the file is saved, hence the filename saved in the annotation is the correct one.
\par \pard \b User Text\plain\fs24 . This read only parameter is set to the User Text field of the last TIFF file loaded or saved.
\par \page
