\b\fs36\cf1 Export for Video Printer
\par \pard \plain\fs24 This function requested from the\uldb \b  Pop up Menu\plain\b\fs24 {\v Context_Sensitive_Popup_Menu}\plain\fs24  selects Video Printer as Output Device.
\par The Software does not initiate the printing, as this device is not controlled from the software, however it does select the output device calibration as previously calibrated for this device.
\par Additionally when this command is given a macro VIDEO PRINT is executed which provides an uncluttered display for 15 seconds to permit the user to initiate the print.
\par This macro may be \uldb \b customised\plain\b\fs24 {\v N31_RN@leom.hlp}\plain\fs24 .
\par \page
